 reference is stored since AIUE-94, and its test_variants.py test catch it (AIUE-96 D7): the blocks are those
 where the variant's stored flag difference departs from the default's (its jflag_block_l2), the integration's
 share, which the mutation removes by integrating in the +1 evaluation too. The other families
 run at their defaults as negative controls (ishosor = 0 in the owner families too).

